        "t": 607.50977,
        "r": 524.5300400000003,
        "b": 584.26977
      },
      "content": "These are the product and product handling requirements for Ex-approved products in potentially explosive atmospheres:",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_133",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_133",
          "title": "Product and product handling requirements"
        }
      ],
      "page": 10,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0120",
      "reading_order": 135,
      "section": "Product and product handling requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.00004,
        "t": 582.3406600000001,
        "r": 420.31004000000013,
        "b": 571.1006600000001
      },
      "content": "Only use the product in accordance with the approved motor data.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_133",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_133",
          "title": "Product and product handling requirements"
        }
      ],
      "page": 10,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0121",
      "reading_order": 136,
      "section": "Product and product handling requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.00002,
        "t": 569.63918,
        "r": 548.3500200000003,
        "b": 546.39918
      },
      "content": "The Ex-approved product must never run dry during normal operation. Dry running during service and inspection is only permitted outside the classified area.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_133",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_133",
          "title": "Product and product handling requirements"
        }
      ],
      "page": 10,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0122",
      "reading_order": 137,
      "section": "Product and product handling requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.0,
        "t": 544.9377,
        "r": 546.7900000000004,
        "b": 521.6976999999999
      },
      "content": "Before you start work on the product, make sure that the product and the control panel are isolated from the power supply and the control circuit, so they cannot be energized.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_133",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_133",
          "title": "Product and product handling requirements"
        }
      ],
      "page": 10,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0123",
      "reading_order": 138,
      "section": "Product and product handling requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 152.99996,
        "t": 520.23622,
        "r": 474.15996000000007,
        "b": 508.99622
      },
      "content": "Do not open the product while it is energized or in an explosive gas atmosphere.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_133",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_133",
          "title": "Product and product handling requirements"
        }
      ],
      "page": 10,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0124",
      "reading_order": 139,
      "section": "Product and product handling requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 152.99993999999998,
        "t": 507.53474,
        "r": 530.3399400000005,
        "b": 484.29474
      },
      "content": "Make sure that thermal contacts are connected to a protection circuit according to the approval classification of  the product, and that they are in use.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_133",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_133",
          "title": "Product and product handling requirements"
        }
      ],
      "page": 10,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0125",
      "reading_order": 140,
      "section": "Product and product handling requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 152.99994,
        "t": 482.83326,
        "r": 536.1599400000003,
        "b": 459.59326
      },
      "content": "Intrinsically safe circuits are normally required for the automatic level-control system by the level regulator if  mounted in zone 0.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_133",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_133",
          "title": "Product and product handling requirements"
        }
      ],
      "page": 10,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0126",
      "reading_order": 141,
      "section": "Product and product handling requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 152.99992,
        "t": 458.13178,
        "r": 527.5599200000004,
        "b": 434.89178
      },
      "content": "The yield stress of  fasteners must be in accordance with the approval drawing and the product specification.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_133",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_133",
          "title": "Product and product handling requirements"
        }
      ],
      "page": 10,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
